  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - \r\nThe London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 16/6/08, the erection of a detached single storey outbuilding to the rear of the house, measuring 3.8m high by 6.5m wide by 5.4m depth was not lawful within the meaning of Section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reason:\r\nThe development would not fall within the provisions of Schedule 2, Part 1, Class E of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) Order 1995 because the outbuilding would be nearer to the highway than the original house.\r\n\r\n"
